  "title": "· New Arrivals | Louis Vuitton Launches Flight Mode Fall/Winter 2026 Collection: Train Travel ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Louis Vuitton 上架 Flight Mode 2026秋冬系列：火车旅行",
  "excerpt": "Louis Vuitton's new Flight Mode collection draws on train travel romance, reimagining Low Key bags in deep red and walnut, and icons in blue and green jacquard canvas.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-10-01",
  "date_label": "October 01, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/sf7kskd/cf4e5781f3b3bafa.jpg",
  "tags": [
