  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton has just unveiled its latest \"Flight Mode\" collection, and this season takes its cue from the romance of train travel. The house reimagines its Low Key bags in Monogram Rogue deep red and walnut tones, while icons like the Neverfull and Side Trunk arrive in blue and Vert Jura Monogram Emblème canvas, their finely woven jacquard motifs lending an embroidered, three-dimensional texture that reads as a bold visual signature.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
