    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Introduced in 2024, the Low Key line is defined by its metal padlock engraved with the LV Initial emblem. The new Low Key Hobo in the small size comes in hazelnut suede with a dark brown strap and lining, or in a walnut-toned palette, with these classic earth shades setting a distinctly autumnal mood.",
