    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Monogram Emblème Jacquard Canvas ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Monogram Emblème jacquard canvas line draws on the classic cotton canvas used for the house's very first trunks in 1896. Woven from five colored yarns, it boasts a distinctive embossed texture that is both hard-wearing and water-repellent. This season introduces an all-new blue series inspired by \"Monogram Bleu,\" the shade recorded in the archives in the 1930s, applied across such icons as the Neverfull, OnTheGo and Speedy, with navy leather trim and contrast stitching for an easy, relaxed feel.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
