    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new \"Vert Jura\" colorway takes its inspiration from the natural landscapes of the Jura mountains, the birthplace of founder Louis Vuitton. It appears across a range of bags including the Side Trunk, CarryAll Travel, All in and Alma, with deep green leather trim and contrast stitching tracing each edge. The green palette evokes lush vegetation for a soothing, leisurely mood.",
