    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The classic Monogram canvas line welcomes the new OnTheGo Soft, which reshapes the iconic tote in supple canvas with a striped textile lining, its soft lines evoking an easy, unhurried spirit. It comes in medium and small sizes: the small includes a detachable long strap, while the medium offers both long and short straps so it can be carried by hand or on the shoulder. The new CarryAll Travel and Flânerie 45 bags offer generous capacity, making them ideal for weekend getaways. Inside the Coffret 8 Montres watch case, vintage hotel-themed embroidery by Japanese artist Yukiko Kitajima offers an early taste of the holiday season.",
